From 935eca591993a0894c991919b75a3f30fa019838 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Bergin <peter@berginkonsult.se>
Date: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 14:06:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: tegra: fix missing I2S codec controls with
 audio-graph-card2

tegra_machine_add_i2s_codec_controls() searches each runtime DAI link
for the nvidia,ahub-i2s-id property, which it reads from the CPU-side
of_node to determine which I2S controller the link belongs to.

With audio-graph-card2 DPCM and component_chaining, XBAR-I2S backend
links have a dummy CPU DAI whose of_node is NULL. The I2S controller
appears on the codec side of the link instead. The NULL check on
cpus->of_node caused the loop to skip every backend link, so no I2S
codec controls were ever registered.

Fall back to codecs->of_node when the CPU side has no of_node. The
nvidia,ahub-i2s-id property is present on the I2S controller DT node
regardless of which side of the link it appears on.

AI-Generated: Uses Claude
Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Peter Bergin <peter@berginkonsult.se>
Signed-off-by: Peter Bergin <peter.bergin@1x.tech>
---
 sound/soc/tegra/tegra_asoc_machine.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/tegra/tegra_asoc_machine.c b/sound/soc/tegra/tegra_asoc_machine.c
index bbdf5e1..950b4dc 100644
--- a/sound/soc/tegra/tegra_asoc_machine.c
+++ b/sound/soc/tegra/tegra_asoc_machine.c
@@ -263,6 +263,10 @@ int tegra_machine_add_i2s_codec_controls(struct snd_soc_card *card)
 	list_for_each_entry(rtd, &card->rtd_list, list) {
 		np = rtd->dai_link->cpus->of_node;

+		/* With audio-graph-card2 DPCM the I2S controller is codec-side */
+		if (!np && rtd->dai_link->num_codecs > 0)
+			np = rtd->dai_link->codecs->of_node;
+
 		if (!np)
 			continue;

